{"id":"e625fcd48b90e0b408e5e047f5499679a5325a67","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232392","title":"DeepSeek V4 Flash 接入 Codex 体验如何","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"andie","excerpt":"程序员 - @andie - 哪一家 Token Plan 或者费用方案比较合理还是说官方 API / OpenRouter","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943533\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d7d6/b748/827090_normal.png?m=1785414497\" alt=\"longlongbig78\" data-uid=\"827090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/longlongbig78\">longlongbig78</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 10:47:30 +08:00\">21h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还不错的，目前用起来和 glm5.2 差不多，比 deepseek-v4-pro-preview 强，多模态就 mcp 接入 gemini-3.5-flash<br>我现在用的是 opencode ，可以去找毛子买，一般 16-17r 左右就能拿下 go ，一个月中高强度也用不完（对话一天可能才 3%）<br>有 vps 的话，也可以用 commandcode ，一个月 9r 左右，额度比 opencode 少（ 10 刀好像，也完全够用了），然后 vps 反代出来用（不过不知道现在上了最新的 flash 没）<br>然后直接官方 API / OpenRouter 也行，也不贵，但是性价比就没那么高了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943572\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11822edc4b3c35c89dfd3b833f45b426?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"foryou2023\" data-uid=\"626307\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/foryou2023\">foryou2023</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 10:54:43 +08:00\">21h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>还行，坚持几天，这个月官方的 harness 应该就要发布了，到时候直接切换即可。</p><p>套餐的话，看自己日常的消耗 Token 量大小，少的自己接 api ，多的话，目前看到的是 opencode 的套餐貌似比较划算，看到别人的统计 套餐大概能花 60 亿左右的 Token</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943633\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/659f/4561/619885_normal.png?m=1785327170\" alt=\"andie\" data-uid=\"619885\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/andie\">andie</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:01:57 +08:00\">21h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/longlongbig78\">longlongbig78</a> 谢谢，没想到 opencode go 这么便宜，我 10 刀原价定了好几个月了😭，应该怎么联系？</p><p>不过 opencode go 的 API 端点只有 chat completions 和 messages 吧，不支持 responses ，没办法接入到 codex 里面</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943854\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/32c4cbaf6d15745f0c2582540a7038b7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jedeft\" data-uid=\"427671\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jedeft\">jedeft</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:32:29 +08:00\">20h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>买 qoder ， 一个月 59 块，dsv4 flash 0.1 倍率，不过还是得悠着用，我 2 天就把一个月的量给蹬完了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943874\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/659f/4561/619885_normal.png?m=1785327170\" alt=\"andie\" data-uid=\"619885\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/andie\">andie</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:35:19 +08:00\">20h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jedeft\">jedeft</a> 能统计到 input / output / cached token 吗，看看对比订阅费 59 和官方 API 原价，倍率是多少，才知道值不值得</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17943953\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/075a4d1aeb8729b59bd50b3407dbc185?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Metatron7\" data-uid=\"311116\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Metatron7\">Metatron7</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 11:43:46 +08:00\">20h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>毛子早被封了，还在毛子，可以去买 ollama pro</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944106\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/32c4cbaf6d15745f0c2582540a7038b7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jedeft\" data-uid=\"427671\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jedeft\">jedeft</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 12:04:59 +08:00\">19h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/andie\">andie</a> 只能看到 Credits 用量，这是 qoder 封装的计费单位，没有 token 统计。我感觉用官方 api 划算一点。我目前换成了 zed + dsv4 官方 api ，一次调用就几分钱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944150\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d7d6/b748/827090_normal.png?m=1785414497\" alt=\"longlongbig78\" data-uid=\"827090\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/longlongbig78\">longlongbig78</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 12:13:17 +08:00\">19h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Yishanshan\">Yishanshan</a> https://plati.market/ 我的用了 20 天还没事，好像掉了能补，但是这个平台好像没有售后的，然后后面的我就不回复了，刚来的新人，我没什么铜币😭</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17944206\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ebb0f1f218e0560dd718e1c7e211b10f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"rockcat\" data-uid=\"297533\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rockcat\">rockcat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 12:30:18 +08:00\">19h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>接 opencode 吧，毕竟 codex 不会也不可能对 ds 做优化的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"1 longlongbig78 21h 16m ago 还不错的，目前用起来和 glm5.2 差不多，比 deepseek-v4-pro-preview 强，多模态就 mcp 接入 gemini-3.5-flash我现在用的是 opencode ，可以去找毛子买，一般 16-17r 左右就能拿下 go ，一个月中高强度也用不完（对话一天可能才 3%）有 vps